# Root .env — read ONLY by `docker compose` (pnpm docker:up) to substitute the
# local service ports in docker-compose.yml. It is NOT loaded by the web app or
# the Eve agent: Next.js reads apps/web/.env.local and `eve dev` reads
# apps/agent/.env.local. Per-app configuration lives in those files — see
# apps/web/.env.example and apps/agent/.env.example.
#
# Copy this to `.env` only if you need to override the default local ports;
# both already default to the values below, so for a standard setup you can
# skip the root .env entirely.

# Host port for the local Postgres container (container listens on 5432).
# TENDNOTE_POSTGRES_PORT=55432
# Host port for the local Redis container (container listens on 6379).
# TENDNOTE_REDIS_PORT=56379
